{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会in京都"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のミニライブで\n他の星から初披露しました！\n振り付けかっこ良いんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ後にサプライズで\nゆったん二十歳の誕生日を\nお祝いしました！\nゆったんおめでとう♪\nこれからも乃木坂の\nムードメーカーでいてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会レーン抽選会で\n生駒と一緒になったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ふぁむのみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさんも\nありがとうございました！\n個握楽しみだねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトをおいしく食べれる\nレシピ教えてヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"砂糖かけて食べてからハマって\n何も付けなくても\n食べられるようになったよ。\n砂糖、醤油、ごま油を混ぜてかけて\n食べたら更に美味しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手な食べ物は\nどうやって克服します？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなドレッシングかけたり、\n小さく切って食べたり、\n嫌いなものでも、体にいいものは\n美容のために薬だと思って\n頑張って食べるんだよ。\nえらいでしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はきのこと貝と健闘してるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モンスターズインクの\n映画観る予定ある⁇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度一人で観に行こうと思ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意料理はなんですか？(^o^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ得意と言えるものがないから\n自信がついたら言うねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメの\n涼しくなる方法があれば教えて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怪談！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでそんなに\n肌が真っ白なんですか〜？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ白じゃないよーほめ過ぎよー\n日焼け止めクリームは\n忘れずちゃんとぬってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏、気になるアイテムは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厚底サンダルとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪つくってないんですけど、\nロングで出来る、\nオススメの髪型ってありますかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子と三つ編みと編み込み！\n長い髪はとことん遊べ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長い前髪も斜めに三つ編みとかしたら\nめっちゃかわいいと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかってチークの入れ方に\nこだわりがあったりする？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜんぶメイクさんに\nおまかせしてる笑\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC中、さゆと遊びまくってることに\n気づいてるかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイライン上手くひけなくて\n目元はななみにやってもらったよ。\nななみありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、橋本先生！\n自分でできるように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/21/1313289/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}